# Omen Alpha — findings by Iceman

- Source: OpenCode Go / TokenRa (anonymous stealth model, `omen-alpha`)
- Date: 2026-11-14 (UTC), deep second-pass research
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Omen Alpha
- **Short description:** Omen Alpha is an anonymous stealth coding/reasoning model served via OpenCode Go and TokenRa routes (`omen-alpha`), with undisclosed vendor/parameters and limited public evidence (primarily a dated OpenCode coding leaderboard snapshot), insufficient for standardized repo scoring.
- **Provider / access:** Anonymous vendor/route access via OpenCode Go data namespace references (community/site reporting points to `zhipu/omen-alpha`) and TokenRa API (`zen/go/v1/chat/completions`, model ID `omen-alpha`). Local metadata lists `omen-alpha`, `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** First spotted around 2026-09-04 per reviewed pages; release/knowledge cutoff not officially disclosed.
- **IDs:** `omen-alpha`.
- **Context window:** ~500,000 tokens reported by community/third-party listings; 128,000 max output claimed in local metadata (not officially/independently verified as a model card spec).
- **Modalities:** Text input/output confirmed by API usage context; image input claimed by some pages/metadata (not consistently/officially verified).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-14):** $0.20/$0.66 per 1M in/out, $0.04 cached read reported on omenalpha.io/TokenRa; local metadata also notes TokenRa promo $0.08/$0.26 and OpenCode Go subscription/credit access context. Pricing/availability may vary by route.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary/undisclosed. Vendor, lineage, and parameter count not officially confirmed (community hypotheses exist but are not authoritative).

### Raw benchmarks found

> SECOND-PASS SELF-EXCLUSION (updated): I reviewed omenalpha.io (home/benchmarks/what-is/how-to-use/about), OpenCode Go docs and related OpenCode docs/searches, TokenRa landing/register page context, aicodingdaily model page, models.dev API/search, OpenRouter API/search, Artificial Analysis search, Hugging Face search, and local metadata/prior report. I found a dated, non-standard public coding snapshot but no standardized, independently verifiable benchmark suite results for this exact model suitable for this project’s comparable 1–100 scoring (e.g. GPQA/HLE/AIME, SWE-bench Verified/Pro, LiveCodeBench, terminal/τ-bench suites, multimodal benchmarks). To avoid unverifiable or misattributed scoring, this file remains `.md.excluded` (notes only; scores ignored).

Agent / tool use:

- OpenCode coding leaderboard snapshot (omenalpha.io benchmarks page, dated 2026-09-04, OpenCode environment): **23.14/40 total** (project rows: CSV import PHP 4/5, Offline sync PHP 3.5/5, Bank feed Dart/Flutter 2.7/5, Shipping quotes Go 3/5; expanded code-quality component 9.94/20 reported), **rank #15**, **avg $0.03/prompt**, **avg 01:51/prompt**. Non-standard/not independently reproduced in this pass.
- Terminal-Bench 2.1 / Tau2 / Tau3 / GDPval-AA / Toolathon / MCP-Atlas: **no verified public score found**

