### Normalized scores (1–100)

Not provided. Insufficient independently verifiable, standardized public benchmark evidence for this exact stealth model; identity/vendor/specs are partially unconfirmed and the only located coding result is a dated non-standard OpenCode snapshot. No scored assessment is issued and this report remains self-excluded.

### Source comparison / conflicts

- **Identity/vendor:** omenalpha.io and related reporting describe Omen Alpha as anonymous/stealth with unresolved attribution (Z.ai/GLM lineage hypothesized but not officially confirmed). OpenCode data namespace references cited by pages (`zhipu/omen-alpha`) were not directly fetchable as a public benchmark page in this pass (404 observed on attempted URL).
- **Specs/modalities:** Context/pricing/modality claims vary by source and are not consistently backed by an official model card. OpenRouter/models.dev/AA/HF catalogs searched in this pass did not provide a verifiable standardized listing/benchmark entry for this exact ID.
- **Benchmarks:** Only a dated OpenCode coding snapshot (23.14/40, 2026-09-04) was found via omenalpha.io/aicodingdaily-linked context; this is not equivalent to standardized repo benchmarks and was not independently reproduced.

